     patch's values. Encroachment suppression waits on EXPLOSIVE_PLANT_GROWTH_1 and is not built here. -->
<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Sulleth</defName>
    <label>sulleth</label>
    <description>A long, low grazer on quick slender legs, hide a dusky violet barred along the flanks with lime green, neck held forward and nose down to the next mouthful. It is always eating and always leaving the evidence: a herd mows a swath through the understory and trails filth and new sprouts behind it, which is less waste than strategy. Docile enough to be kept as livestock.</description>
